WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.860
Hey guys, here's my take on FF21.

00:03.440 --> 00:04.760
So the moment I came here,

00:05.040 --> 00:06.680
like I let the introvert out of me.

00:06.680 --> 00:07.940
This is the best place to

00:07.940 --> 00:09.960
do that and it's more of like

00:10.560 --> 00:13.040
